WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.275 --> 00:00:01.685
You are not Robin of Locksley anymore.

00:00:02.005 --> 00:00:03.005
You are Robin Hood.

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:07.480
You were a Lord.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:10.280
But now you get to be a thief.

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:13.800
And I am going to show you how.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:18.340
Shoot me.

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:23.340
Please.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:25.160
You have to be a warrior.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:29.120
As fast as you can.

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:31.800
Faster.

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:33.820
What are you doing to my coat?

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:38.760
Again.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.160
When do I actually get to you know steal?

00:00:49.715 --> 00:00:50.715
What else you got?

00:00:52.405 --> 00:00:53.915
There's been whispers

00:00:55.065 --> 00:00:56.065
of a thief.

00:00:57.815 --> 00:00:59.175
I am the law and order here.

00:01:02.725 --> 00:01:04.785
Any talk of the thief, bring it to me.

00:01:06.485 --> 00:01:08.245
One thing keeps him in power.

00:01:09.055 --> 00:01:11.785
The money, we steal it. Wanna hit the treasury itself.

00:01:11.785 --> 00:01:13.140
Setup a meeting.

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:14.900
Everyone is with us.

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:15.920
This is our shot.

00:01:18.415 --> 00:01:19.495
Here is the plan.

00:01:21.125 --> 00:01:24.155
This is an inside job. You are the lord.

00:01:26.285 --> 00:01:29.045
Get closer to sheriff. Who do you think deceive this?

00:01:29.585 --> 00:01:31.155
Clearly he is well trained.

00:01:33.045 --> 00:01:34.615
Adaptable under fire.

00:01:35.185 --> 00:01:36.495
You'll get him eventually.

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:43.820
Our plan is working.

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:45.460
Now we see you right.

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:52.240
I'll remind them they are not the people, they are my subjects.

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:54.740
This is  suicide.

00:01:56.060 --> 00:01:57.200
Can't you see what you are doing?

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:00.620
You inspire the people.

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:04.380
A thousand pounds

00:02:04.660 --> 00:02:05.660
for the man who brings me Hood.

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:11.820
We are all suspects now.

00:02:12.475 --> 00:02:14.325
If we get caught they will kill us all.

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:18.200
Really inspiring, thanks.

00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:21.180
You are not Robin of Locksley anymore.

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:24.400
You are Robin Hood.

